abstract: >-
  CGNK is a composable capability kernel for evidence-grounded agentic
  project work with localized knowledge, bounded executors, persistent state,
  deterministic validation, and governed capability growth.
keywords:
  - agent systems
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - capability routing
  - evidence provenance
